 "政策及解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/t20250401_2112566.htm", "content": "\n　　根据《福建省人力资源和社会保障厅 福建省财政厅 国家税务总局福建省税务局印发<福建省失业保险基金省级统筹实施方案>的通知》《福建省人力资源和社会保障厅关于公布我省最低工资标准的通知》文件规定，市人社局", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/t20250401_2112566.htm", "docreltime": "2025.04.02 10:14:00", "doctitle": "保民生促稳定——三明市上调失业金标准", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2307487, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/t20250401_2112566.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2107424, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策及解读", "chnldocurl": "https://www.fujian.gov.cn/zwgk/zfxxgk/szfwj/jgzz/xzgfxwj/202501/t20250127_6710129.htm", "content": "", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "https://www.fujian.gov.cn/zwgk/zfxxgk/szfwj/jgzz/xzgfxwj/202501/t20250127_6710129.htm", "docreltime": "2025.01.27 10:52:00", "doctitle": "福建省人民政府办公厅关于健全基本医疗保险参保长效机制的实施意见", "doctype": 30, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2301454, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 30, "url": "https://www.fujian.gov.cn/zwgk/zfxxgk/szfwj/jgzz/xzgfxwj/202501/t20250127_6710129.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2096504, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策及解读", "chnldocurl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202501/t20250121_2096504.htm", "content": "\n　　一、支持企业春节期间连续生产\n　　对经当地工信部门认定，2025年春节当月保持连续生产的规模以上工业企业，1月用电量不低于2024年12月用电量75%（含75%）的，按用工人数（以1月份企业参加失业保险人数为准）给", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202501/t20250121_2096504.htm", "docreltime": "2025.01.21 15:59:00", "doctitle": "三明市2025年保用工促开局十条措施及政策申报指南", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2302509, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202501/t20250121_2096504.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202501/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2060838, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策及解读", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/ylbzj/zfxxgkml/zcwj/202409/t20240914_2060838.htm", "content": "\n\n\n市医保局各派出机构，各县（市、区）教育局、卫健局、妇儿工委办公室、妇联：\n现将《福建省医疗保障局等五部门转发关于开展儿童参加基本医疗保险专项行动的通知》（闽医保〔2024〕36号）转发给你们，请认真遵照执", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/ylbzj/zfxxgkml/zcwj/202409/t20240914_2060838.htm", "docreltime": "2024.09.14 09:23:00", "doctitle": "三明市医疗保障局等五部门转发关于开展儿童参加基本医疗保险专项行动的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明医保〔2024〕23号", "idxid": "SM00112-0200-2024-00041", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2024.09.14 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市医疗保障局", "recid": 2259133, "sourcename": "三明市医保局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/ylbzj/zfxxgkml/zcwj/202409/t20240914_2060838.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/ylbzj/zfxxgkml/zcwj/202409/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2037200, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策及解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shbxyjz/sybx/202406/t20240625_2037200.htm", "content": "\n　　各市、县（区）人社局、财政局，国家税务总局福建省各市（县、区）税务局，平潭综合实验区社会事业局、财政金融局，国家税务总局平潭综合实验区税务局：\n　　为贯彻落实《人力资源社会保障部、财政部、国家税务", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shbxyjz/sybx/202406/t20240625_2037200.htm", "docreltime": "2024.06.25 09:11:00", "doctitle": "福建省人力资源和社会保障厅 福建省财政厅国家税务总局福建省税务局关于落实失业保险援企稳岗政策的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2245991, "sourcename": "福建省人力资源和社会保障厅", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shbxyjz/sybx/202406/t20240625_2037200.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shbxyjz/sybx/202406/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1987302, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策及解读", "chnldocurl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/fgwj/sjwj/202312/t20231222_1987302.htm", "content": "\n　　各设区市人力资源和社会保障局、财政局，平潭综合实验区社会事业局、财政金融局，国家税务总局福建省各设区市税务局，国家税务总局平潭综合实验区税务局：\n　　根据党中央、国务院实施养老保险全国统筹的决策部", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/fgwj/sjwj/202312/t20231222_1987302.htm", "docreltime": "2023.12.22 16:45:00", "doctitle": "福建省人力资源和社会保障厅 福建省财政厅 国家税务总局福建省税务局关于公布2023年城镇职工基本养老保险计发基数等有关问题的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2245993, "sourcename": "福建人社", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/fgwj/sjwj/202312/t20231222_1987302.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/fgwj/sjwj/202312/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1922645, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策及解读", "chnldocurl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/fgwj/zxwj/202307/t20230710_1922645.htm", "content": "\n　　三元区人民政府：\n　　根据《三明市人民政府关于完善城乡居民基本养老保险制度的若干意见》（明政文〔2014〕149号）精神，经研究，决定从2023年7月1日起，三元区被征地农民养老保障金标准提高到每人每月370元。", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/fgwj/zxwj/202307/t20230710_1922645.htm", "docreltime": "2023.07.10 17:24:00", "doctitle": "关于提高三元区被征地农民养老保障金标准的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明人社〔2023〕176号", "idxid": "SM00113-40-2023-00073", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2023.07.03 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "recid": 2101511, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/fgwj/zxwj/202307/t20230710_1922645.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_